**DIRAC
.TITLE
  LiH
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
**GENERAL
! Direct evaluation of two-electron integrals
.DIRECT
1 1 1
! SPEED OF LIGHT FOR COMPARISON WITH THE DALTON DOUGLAS-KROLL RESULTS
.CVALUE
137.0359895D0
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
1
*TWOINT
**HAMILTONIAN
.SPINFREE
.BSS
102
.CMPEIG
.PRINT
1
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
.RELCCSD
.LUCITA
*SCF
.CLOSED SHELL
10  
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0E-10  1.0D-7
*LUCITA
.INIWFC
  DHFSCF
.CITYPE
  SDCI
.MULTIP
  3
**MOLTRA
.SCHEME
4
.ACTIVE
energy   -1000    999999  0.1
*END OF

 &RELCCSD IPRNT=1, TIMING=T, DOENER=T,  NELEC=4,4, INTERFACE="DIRAC" &END
 &CCSORT USEOE=F &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T      &END


